@startuml F0.1-d-rate-limit
title F0.1-d — Login 429 — rate limit atingido
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "RateLimitFilter" as RateLimit
participant "AuthController" as AuthController

Usuario -> WebApp: nova tentativa / Entrar
WebApp -> RateLimit: POST /auth/login

note right of RateLimit
  ≥ 5 tentativas / min
  (IP + identificador)
  RN-F0.1-06
end note

RateLimit --> WebApp: 429 Problem Details\n(+ retryAfterSeconds)
note over AuthController #EEEEEE
  AuthController / LoginUseCase
  nunca invocados
end note
WebApp --> Usuario: AlertBanner warning\n+ countdown (RN-F0.1-09)

@enduml
